    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_4_e1",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_6",
      "quote": "This study aims to address the following research questions: First, what are the key international indicators and standards for measuring the success of addiction treatment? Second, which treatment modalities used in SUD treatment centers are most effective in improving abstinence rates, preventing relapse, enhancing quality of life (QoL), and facilitating social reintegration among patients? The primary objective is to identify and evaluate international indicators of success in SUD treatment and to determine the effectiveness of various treatment methods employed in SUD treatment centers.",
      "reason": "The Introduction section explicitly states the research questions and primary objectives of the review."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_4_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_8",
      "quote": "The PICO framework-Population, Intervention, Comparison, Outcome ، was utilized to structure the research question and guide the review process(20).",
      "reason": "The review addresses intervention effects (comparing treatment modalities), and the PICO framework is explicitly stated as the structure used to formulate the research question."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 95
}

